{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/work/layout,_N_T_/work/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/work/[slug]/page,_N_T_/work/intent-first-ux"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--3_YsJYZWrodYXcBUxiXYU--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/0081af9fd4fec0e1.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/77601ebe1fbe3da2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5c5613942f47120d.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-3d881dfa8c72bc56.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-60b53674f5a8114a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-6a8cee1febeac4c4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/874-1ba6df67fefa8f44.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/work/%5Bslug%5D/page-0cf8da57f2058038.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Anupam Sarkar — Designing where AI is the material</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Portfolio of Anupam Sarkar. Senior product designer building AI-native products. The interface is the agent.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Anupam Sarkar — AI-native product design\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The interface is the agent. Twelve years of work.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Anupam Sarkar — AI-native product design\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"The interface is the agent. Twelve years of work.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><canvas aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;mix-blend-mode:screen\"></canvas><div class=\"grid-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><nav class=\"Nav_nav__o8sSc\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Nav_row__TbWky\"><a class=\"Nav_brand__vMusG\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"Nav_dot__Z8Jyv\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"Nav_brandText__Rf0lb\">Anupam <span class=\"serif-italic\">Sarkar</span></span></a><div class=\"Nav_links__8Axcs\"><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/\">Work</a><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/frameworks\">Frameworks</a><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Nav_linkAccent__UnO49\" href=\"/contact\">Contact ↗</a></div></div></div></nav><aside class=\"CaseStudySpine_spine__BrrZ0\" aria-label=\"Case study progress\"><div class=\"CaseStudySpine_label__rSQSU\">case · layers</div><ol class=\"CaseStudySpine_list__U1Qd_\"><li class=\"CaseStudySpine_layer__K0HZ9 CaseStudySpine_active__dgh9M\"><a href=\"#hero\"><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_dot__FJ3V7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_num__Rd7nc\">0<!-- -->1</span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_layerLabel__tAJKA\">Hero</span></a></li><li class=\"CaseStudySpine_layer__K0HZ9 \"><a href=\"#middle\"><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_dot__FJ3V7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_num__Rd7nc\">0<!-- -->2</span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_layerLabel__tAJKA\">Middle</span></a></li><li class=\"CaseStudySpine_layer__K0HZ9 \"><a href=\"#depth\"><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_dot__FJ3V7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_num__Rd7nc\">0<!-- -->3</span><span class=\"CaseStudySpine_layerLabel__tAJKA\">Depth</span></a></li></ol></aside><main><section id=\"hero\" class=\"page_hero__Z_1YN\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page_heroMeta__kmrSv\"><span class=\"page_tag__El_eL\">Framework · IFU</span><span>·</span><span>2025</span></div><h1 class=\"page_title__qmGz_\">Intent-First UX — the <em>framework</em> I use to design AI</h1><p class=\"page_intro__AQqV8\">Intent-First UX (IFU) is the framework I wrote in 2025 after I noticed every AI product I had been hired to design was failing the same four moments. It is now used inside two unannounced agent products at AI labs, and taught as method at Cohere and Druid. The framework is the case.</p><div class=\"page_heroArtifact__9W71l\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"bet-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0.5\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0.5\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7dffce\" stop-opacity=\"0.1\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#7dffce\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></line><path d=\"M 20 60 L 160 60 L 150 50 M 160 60 L 150 70\" stroke=\"url(#bet-g)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7dffce\" opacity=\"0.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"60\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"20\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" letter-spacing=\"1\">today</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#7dffce\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" letter-spacing=\"1\">the bet</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">the predictable failure pattern</span></div></div><ul class=\"StatStrip_strip__b94z6\"><li class=\"StatStrip_stat__kPw3h\"><div class=\"StatStrip_value__yvSsr\"><span class=\"serif-italic\">4</span></div><div class=\"StatStrip_label__e15lU\">stages · sense / morph / confirm / escape</div></li><li class=\"StatStrip_stat__kPw3h\"><div class=\"StatStrip_value__yvSsr\"><span class=\"serif-italic\">2</span></div><div class=\"StatStrip_label__e15lU\">AI labs using internally</div></li><li class=\"StatStrip_stat__kPw3h\"><div class=\"StatStrip_value__yvSsr\"><span class=\"serif-italic\">11</span></div><div class=\"StatStrip_label__e15lU\">products audited with it</div></li><li class=\"StatStrip_stat__kPw3h\"><div class=\"StatStrip_value__yvSsr\"><span class=\"serif-italic\">0</span></div><div class=\"StatStrip_label__e15lU\">stages anyone has added</div></li></ul></div></section><section id=\"middle\" class=\"page_middle__8TYZs\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page_layerLabel__jlWsQ\">// layer 02 · middle</div><h2 class=\"page_layerTitle__PsrE5\">Six artifacts. <em>Each carries the argument.</em></h2><div class=\"page_cards__4ivId\"><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">BET</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">01</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">If AI interfaces are failing in the same four predictable moments, then a framework that names the moments will let any designer ship calmer, more trustworthy agents — without inventing language each time.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"bet-g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0.5\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0.5\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#7dffce\" stop-opacity=\"0.1\"></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#7dffce\" stop-opacity=\"0.9\"></stop></linearGradient></defs><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></line><path d=\"M 20 60 L 160 60 L 150 50 M 160 60 L 150 70\" stroke=\"url(#bet-g)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#7dffce\" opacity=\"0.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"60\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"20\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" letter-spacing=\"1\">today</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#7dffce\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" letter-spacing=\"1\">the bet</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">the predictable failure pattern</span></div></div></article><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">ALT</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">02</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">I considered four-quadrants, decision trees, and a heuristic checklist. Each one collapsed the moment a designer asked: which moment am I in right now? Stages were the only model that survived contact.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\"><rect width=\"160\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"></rect><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#ff4d8b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\">alt 0<!-- -->1<!-- --> — rejected</text></g><g transform=\"translate(20, 50)\"><rect width=\"160\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"></rect><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#ff4d8b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\">alt 0<!-- -->2<!-- --> — rejected</text></g><g transform=\"translate(20, 80)\"><rect width=\"160\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"></rect><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#ff4d8b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line><text x=\"8\" y=\"14\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\">alt 0<!-- -->3<!-- --> — rejected</text></g></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">three rejected models</span></div></div></article><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">CONSTRAINT</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">03</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">Frameworks rot. Mine had to be short enough to memorise, generative enough to redraw, and embarrassing enough to be obviously incomplete if I added a fifth stage.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7dffce\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"></rect><rect x=\"60\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(125,255,206,0.06)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\" stroke-opacity=\"0.8\"></rect><path d=\"M 100 10 l 0 8\" stroke=\"#f5c66b\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></path><path d=\"M 190 60 l -8 0\" stroke=\"#f5c66b\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></path><path d=\"M 100 110 l 0 -8\" stroke=\"#f5c66b\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></path><path d=\"M 10 60 l 8 0\" stroke=\"#f5c66b\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></path><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 z\" fill=\"#f5c66b\"></path></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"64\" fill=\"#7dffce\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">surface</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">the four-word constraint</span></div></div></article><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">SYSTEM</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">04</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">Sense the intent. Morph the surface. Confirm the action. Escape the loop. Each stage has its own failure mode, its own metric, and its own gesture. The system is the spine.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"79\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\"></line><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.15)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"40\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"1\">sense</text></g><g><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\"></line><circle cx=\"87\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.15)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"87\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"1\">morph</text></g><g><line x1=\"141\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"172\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#00d4ff\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\"></line><circle cx=\"133\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.15)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"133\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"1\">confirm</text></g><g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"60\" r=\"8\" fill=\"rgba(0,212,255,0.15)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"180\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"1\">escape</text></g><text x=\"100\" y=\"30\" fill=\"#7dffce\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"2\">IFU SPINE</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">the IFU spine</span></div></div></article><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">ARTIFACT</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">05</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">The critique surface — the screenshot-scoring tool on /frameworks — runs Claude against the IFU rubric in real time. The framework is not a PDF; it is a working evaluator.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"10\" width=\"160\" height=\"100\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(10,13,20,0.6)\" stroke=\"#7dffce\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"></rect><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#3a4156\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"></line><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7dffce\"></circle><text x=\"42\" y=\"22\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"6\" font-family=\"monospace\">surface · v1</text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#7dffce\" opacity=\"0.6\"></rect><rect x=\"32\" y=\"52\" width=\"120\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#3a4156\"></rect><rect x=\"32\" y=\"62\" width=\"100\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#3a4156\"></rect><rect x=\"32\" y=\"72\" width=\"60\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#3a4156\"></rect><rect x=\"32\" y=\"88\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#7dffce\"></rect><text x=\"55\" y=\"97\" fill=\"#05060a\" font-size=\"6\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\">action →</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">the critique evaluator</span></div></div></article><article class=\"ArtifactCard_card___XmVC\"><div class=\"ArtifactCard_tag__IQpsb\"><span class=\"ArtifactCard_kind__cjLTf\">RESULT</span><span class=\"ArtifactCard_num__jGVwF\">06</span></div><p class=\"ArtifactCard_caption__LNt5_\">Adopted at two AI labs and three enterprise products. The strongest signal isn&#x27;t usage — it&#x27;s that designers I have never met now use the four stage-names in their own work without crediting me. Frameworks succeed when they disappear.</p><div class=\"ArtifactCard_visual__4vrVD\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_frame__F_BST\"><div class=\"CaseArtifacts_svg__Gz73o\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><text x=\"100\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#7dffce\" font-size=\"44\" font-family=\"Fraunces, Georgia, serif\" font-style=\"italic\" font-weight=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 labs</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#7dffce\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"></line><text x=\"100\" y=\"94\" fill=\"#8089a0\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"monospace\" text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\"2\">MEASURED · POST-SHIP</text></svg></div><span class=\"CaseArtifacts_label__Sny3J\">adoption · unattributed</span></div></div></article></div></div></section><div class=\"container\"><blockquote class=\"PullQuote_q__aBMCT\"><span class=\"PullQuote_mark__5kDBG\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&quot;</span><p>A framework that requires me to be in the room is not a framework. It is a consulting engagement with delusions.</p><span class=\"PullQuote_mark__5kDBG PullQuote_markRight__MyOts\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&quot;</span></blockquote></div><section id=\"depth\" class=\"page_depth__CNMEo\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page_layerLabel__jlWsQ\">// layer 03 · depth</div><h2 class=\"page_layerTitle__PsrE5\">The <em>reasoning</em> behind the surface.</h2><div class=\"page_depthGrid__5NSpR\"><article class=\"page_depthItem__jCa7X\"><h3 class=\"page_depthHeading__BcC_0\">Why every AI product fails the Sense stage first</h3><p class=\"page_depthBody__1gDD9\">Most AI products skip Sense — they assume the user has already typed enough. Sense is the moment the interface decides what kind of intelligence is needed. Get this wrong and the rest of the loop is loud activity in the wrong direction. The fix is almost always: surface less, ask one shaped question, and wait.</p></article><article class=\"page_depthItem__jCa7X\"><h3 class=\"page_depthHeading__BcC_0\">Morph is where designers panic</h3><p class=\"page_depthBody__1gDD9\">Morph is the visible reshaping of the interface to match what was sensed. Designers panic here because it breaks the contract that &#x27;the UI stays still.&#x27; But that contract was always a lie — the UI was reshaping you. Morph just makes it honest. The rule: morph slowly enough that the user can see what changed, fast enough that they don&#x27;t think it broke.</p></article><article class=\"page_depthItem__jCa7X\"><h3 class=\"page_depthHeading__BcC_0\">Escape is the stage no one builds</h3><p class=\"page_depthBody__1gDD9\">Confirm gets attention because it&#x27;s where the action fires. But Escape — the ability to back out of the loop, undo the morph, return to ambient state — is what makes an agent trustworthy. Build Escape first; it is the only stage that retroactively pays for the other three.</p></article></div></div></section><div class=\"container\"><section class=\"EndFrame_end__CpCvl\" data-narrate=\"endframe\"><div class=\"EndFrame_col__qn7Xv\"><div class=\"EndFrame_label__tUF6K\">// what this case proves</div><p class=\"EndFrame_proves__UyCFL\">I write frameworks that travel outside my own work. Method as deliverable.</p></div><div class=\"EndFrame_col__qn7Xv\"><div class=\"EndFrame_label__tUF6K\">// next case</div><a class=\"EndFrame_next__lUtYb\" href=\"/work/gravity-spatial-ui\"><span class=\"EndFrame_nextTag__B5uaS\">Framework · GRAVITY</span><span class=\"EndFrame_nextTitle__U7pnM\">GRAVITY — spatial UI for embodied AI<!-- --> <em class=\"EndFrame_arrow__AV7cw\">→</em></span></a></div><div class=\"EndFrame_col__qn7Xv\"><div class=\"EndFrame_label__tUF6K\">// talk to me about this</div><a class=\"EndFrame_cta__uKpi7\" href=\"/contact\">Book a 30-min call →</a></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"FooterCTA_footer__Ixqe_\" data-narrate=\"footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_grid__lUIv3\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_left__6mMWK\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_kicker__bGOAy\">// closing</div><h2 class=\"FooterCTA_title__IVNFn\">You&#x27;ve read this far.<br/><span class=\"serif-italic\">Let&#x27;s talk.</span></h2><p class=\"FooterCTA_sub__SMCHf\">I&#x27;m interviewing for Design Director and AI Product Design Lead roles in 2026. I prefer async-first conversation that gets concrete fast.</p></div><div class=\"FooterCTA_right__b4FDk\"><button class=\"FooterCTA_primary__JPu79\">Book a 30-min call →</button><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"#\">Download case deck (PDF)</a><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"mailto:ar.anupamsarkar@gmail.com\">ar.anupamsarkar@gmail.com</a><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div><div class=\"FooterCTA_meta__zUBAe\"><span>© 2026 Anupam Sarkar</span><span>built · v0.1 · agent-native</span><span>The agent is the form.</span></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><aside class=\"AgentStatusRail_rail__PSUPd\" aria-label=\"Agent status — Chitra\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><header class=\"AgentStatusRail_head__ASvL_\"><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_orb__GPfKP AgentStatusRail_idle__FbaNE\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_title__DnvEW\"><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_name__ib4o6\"><span class=\"serif-italic\">Chitra</span></div><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_meta__rohV9\">agent · v0.1</div></div><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_pill__psDgR AgentStatusRail_idle__FbaNE\">idle</div></header><div class=\"AgentStatusRail_log__yZZ4N\"></div></aside><div class=\"CursorSensor_aura__22Lry\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"CursorSensor_core__EOtR7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5c5613942f47120d.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[2587,[\\\"177\\\